  <ButtonText>k__BackingField: "Ignore les remarques d\u2019Herlock, son avis n\u2019a
    pas d\u2019importance."
  <NpcText>k__BackingField:
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6d7f1579677957f4989c5da3f93a4c8d, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 368af27e801a8f643a3763179d93db07, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Bien s\xFBr, votre avis vaut beaucoup plus \xE0 mes yeux !"
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6d7f1579677957f4989c5da3f93a4c8d, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d35d0e1530830e42b12a5e80d0329dc, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Si vous dites que ma tenue est correcte, alors peu m\u2019importe ce que pense
      ce\u2026"
    - Enfin ce que pense Herlock quoi.
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6d7f1579677957f4989c5da3f93a4c8d, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 15a032d1f64921b49a6cec6c0a26887d, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - Merci Capitaine !
